531.htm", "docreltime": "2023.04.25 17:57:00", "doctitle": "三明市教育局关于做好2023年学前和义务教育阶段招生入学工作的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明教初〔2023〕70号", "idxid": "SM00104-0200-2023-00072", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "2023.04.25 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市教育局", "recid": 2180429, "sourcename": "三明市教育局01", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202403/t20240311_2008531.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "附件1-2.docx", "appdocid": 2008531, "appfile": "P020240311596342468919.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202403/t20240311_2008531.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202403/P020240311/P020240311596342468919.docx", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202403/P020240311596342468919.docx"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202403/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1874851, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "小学教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202301/t20230120_1874851.htm", "content": "\n　　为贯彻落实教育部等六部门《关于印发〈义务教育质量评价指南〉的通知》，近日，省教育厅会同省直有关部门联合印发《福建省义务教育质量评价实施方案》（以下简称《实施方案》），现解读如下：\n　　一、《实施方", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202301/t20230120_1874851.htm", "docreltime": "2023.01.03 16:12:00", "doctitle": "关于《福建省义务教育质量评价实施方案》的政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2018515, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202301/t20230120_1874851.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202301/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1906138, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "小学教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202305/t20230517_1906138.htm", "content": "各县（市、区）教育局、市场监管局、网信办、公安局、民政局、人社局、住建局、金融办、消防救援大队，人行辖内各县市支行、银保监监管组：\n　　为贯彻落实国家、省委省政府和市委市政府关于“双减”工作的决策部署，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202305/t20230517_1906138.htm", "docreltime": "2022.07.07 08:44:00", "doctitle": "三明市教育局　三明市市场监督管理局等十二部门关于印发《三明市深化整治校外培训机构不规范问题减轻中小学生课外负担工作方案》的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明教规〔2022〕104号", "idxid": "SM00104-0200-2022-00149", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "2022.07.04 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市教育局", "recid": 2056460, "sourcename": "三明市教育局01", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202305/t20230517_1906138.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202305/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1804690, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "小学教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202207/t20220707_1804690.htm", "content": "\n　　明教中〔2022〕102号\n　　各县（市、区）教育局，市直属有关学校（单位）：\n　　根据《福建省教育厅关于严格执行中小学校历和作息时间有关规定的通知》（闽教基〔2008〕60号）精神和要求，结合我市实际，现将三", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202207/t20220707_1804690.htm", "docreltime": "2022.07.01 10:34:00", "doctitle": "三明市教育局关于2022—2023学年度中小学校历安排的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明教中〔2022〕102号", "idxid": "SM00104-0200-2022-00148", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "2022.06.30 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市教育局", "recid": 1932141, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202207/t20220707_1804690.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202207/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1804684, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "小学教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202207/t20220707_1804684.htm", "content": "\n　　明教安〔2022〕99号\n　　各县（市、区）教育局，各大中专院校、市直属学校：\n　　2022年暑假即将来临，为防范各类学生伤害事故，加强暑期学校安全防范，确保师生安全，现就做好2022年暑期学校安全工作有关事项通", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202207/t20220707_1804684.htm", "docreltime": "2022.07.01 10:29:00", "doctitle": "三明市教育局关于做好2022年暑期学校安全工作的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明教安〔2022〕99号", "idxid": "SM00104-0200-2022-00147", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "2022.06.29 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市教育局", "recid": 1932135, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202207/t20220707_1804684.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202207/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1804678, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "小学教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202207/t20220707_1804678.htm", "content": "\n　　明教思〔2022〕95号\n　　各县(市、区)教育局，市直属学校：\n　　2022年是党的二十大召开之年，是实施“十四五”规划、开启全面建设社会主义现代化国家新征程的重要一年。习近平总书记在致信祝贺首届全民阅读大会", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202207/t20220707_1804678.htm", "docreltime": "2022.07.01 10:21:00", "doctitle": "三明市教育局关于开展2022年三明市师生“暑期读一本好书”活动的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明教思〔2022〕95号", "idxid": "SM00104-0200-2022-00146", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "2022.06.24 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市教育局", "recid": 1932129, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202207/t20220707_1804678.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "附件.docx", "appdocid": 1804678, "appfile": "P020220707321008531503.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202207/t20220707_1804678.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202207/P020220707/P020220707321008531503.docx", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202207/P020220707321008531503.docx"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202207/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1784195, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "小学教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202205/t20220507_1784195.htm", "content": "\n　　 \n　　日前，教育部印发《义务教育课程方案和课程标准（2022年版）》，教育部教材局负责人就有关内容回答了记者的提问。\n　　1.请问此次义务教育课程修订的背景和意义是什么？ \n　　答：一是党的十九大强调“落", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202205/t20220507_1784195.htm", "docreltime": "2022.05.05 15:49:00", "doctitle": "教育部教材局负责人就《义务教育课程方案和课程标准（2022年版）》答记者问", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1908393, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202205/t20220507_1784195.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202205/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1781031, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "小学教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202204/t20220427_1781031.htm", "content": "\n　　明教初〔2022〕52号\n　　各县（市、区）教育局，局属有关中小学、幼儿园：\n　　为深入推进招生制度改革，大力促进教育公平，根据《教育部办公厅关于进一步做好普通中小学招生入学工作的通知》（教基厅﹝2022﹞1", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202204/t20220427_1781031.htm", "docreltime": "2022.04.20 10:57:00", "doctitle": "三明市教育局关于做好2022年学前和义务教育阶段招生入学工作的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明教初〔2022〕52号", "idxid": "SM00104-0200-2022-00090", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "2022.04.19 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市教育局", "recid": 1904804, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202204/t20220427_1781031.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "附件1-2.docx", "appdocid": 1781031, "appfile": "P020220427285268728709.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202204/t20220427_1781031.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202204/P020220427/P020220427285268728709.docx", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202204/P020220427285268728709.docx"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202204/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1761747, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "小学教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/t20220302_1761747.htm", "content": "\n　　2021年12月27日，教育部部长怀进鹏签署中华人民共和国教育部令第52号，公布《中小学法治副校长聘任与管理办法》（以下简称《办法》），自2022年5月1日起施行。教育部政策法规司负责人就《办法》有关问题回答了记", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/t20220302_1761747.htm", "docreltime": "2022.02.17 15:58:00", "doctitle": "完善中小学治理体系 健全学生权益保护机制", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1881534, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "——教育部政策法规司负责人就《中小学法治副校长聘任与管理办法》答记者问", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/t20220302_1761747.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1761744, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "小学教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/t20220302_1761744.htm", "content": "\n　　中小学法治副校长聘任与管理办法 \n　　第一条 为了完善中小学治理体系，健全学生权益保护机制，进一步规范中小学法治副校长聘任与管理，促进未成年人健康成长，根据教育法、未成年人保护法、预防未成年人犯罪法", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/t20220302_1761744.htm", "docreltime": "2022.02.17 15:52:00", "doctitle": "中小学法治副校长聘任与管理办法", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1881531, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/t20220302_1761744.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1761741, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "小学教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/t20220302_1761741.htm", "content": "\n　　为深入贯彻全国教育大会精神和党的十九届六中全会精神，全面提高我省基础教育质量，办好人民满意的教育，省教育厅等八部门印发了《关于进一步激发中小学办学活力的若干措施》（以下简称《若干措施》）。现将有关", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/t20220302_1761741.htm", "docreltime": "2022.01.18 08:31:00", "doctitle": "关于《关于进一步激发中小学办学活力的若干措施》政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1881528, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/t20220302_1761741.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1761738, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "小学教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/t20220302_1761738.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，省教育厅印发了《福建省教育厅关于进一步加强普通中小学教学常规管理工作的指导意见》（以下简称《指导意见》），现将有关政策解读如下：\n　　一、出台《指导意见》的背景是什么？\n　　教学常规是中小学教", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/t20220302_1761738.htm", "docreltime": "2022.01.18 08:28:00", "doctitle": "关于《福建省教育厅关于进一步加强普通中小学教学常规管理工作的指导意见》政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1881525, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/t20220302_1761738.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1761735, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "小学教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/t20220302_1761735.htm", "content": "\n　　一、开展校外培训项目分类鉴别的背景是什么？\n　　答：今年7月，国家印发《中央办公厅、国务院办公厅关于进一步减轻义务教育阶段学生作业负担和校外培训负担的意见》对规范校外培训提出明确要求。11月,教育部办", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/t20220302_1761735.htm", "docreltime": "2022.01.18 08:26:00", "doctitle": "《福建省中小学生校外培训项目分类鉴别指南》政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1881522, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/t20220302_1761735.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202203/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1732821, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "小学教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/t20211201_1732821.htm", "content": "\n　　    为进一步深化教育综合改革，探索“双减”背景下学校管理的有效路径和方法，促进学校内涵发展，全面提升宁化县小学教育教学质量，11月上旬，宁化县教育局组织开展小学落实“双减”政策暨2021年质量提升研讨系", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/t20211201_1732821.htm", "docreltime": "2021.11.23 10:40:00", "doctitle": "宁化县举办2021年小学落实“双减”政策暨质量提升研讨活动", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1848132, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/t20211201_1732821.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1732820, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "小学教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/t20211201_1732820.htm", "content": "\n　　 \n　　10月22日，宁化县教育局召开中小学幼儿园总校制办学工作推进会。县教育局党组书记、局长兰鹏参会并讲话。县教育局相关分管领导、相关股室负责人，县教师进修学校、各中小学、幼儿园主要负责人参加会议。 ", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/t20211201_1732820.htm", "docreltime": "2021.10.26 08:42:00", "doctitle": "宁化县召开中小学幼儿园总校制办学工作推进会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1848131, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/t20211201_1732820.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1732819, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "小学教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/t20211201_1732819.htm", "content": "\n　　    春风化雨育人心，笃定致远促发展。在教育征途上，沪、明因历史渊源走在一起，共同书写下清晰美好的教育新篇章，一幅美丽的教育图景徐徐展开。 \n　　                \n　　10月21日，三明市委教育工委书记刘", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "三元区沪明小学与上海市虹口区广灵路小学校际合作交流协议正式签订", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/t20211201_1732819.htm", "docreltime": "2021.10.25 16:15:00", "doctitle": "三元区沪明小学与上海市虹口区广灵路小学校际合作交流协议正式签订", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1848130, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/t20211201_1732819.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1732818, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "小学教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/t20211201_1732818.htm", "content": "\n　　9月26日上午，永安市教育改革发展工作组组织召开“双减”政策下全市小学质量提升研讨座谈会。永安市教育改革发展工作组领导廖艳希、范丽琴、林亚蓉、郑晓英、张文周参加座谈会并讲话。会议由永安市人大常委会主", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/t20211201_1732818.htm", "docreltime": "2021.09.27 10:55:00", "doctitle": "永安市召开“双减”政策下小学质量提升研讨座谈会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1848129, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/t20211201_1732818.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1732817, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "小学教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/t20211201_1732817.htm", "content": "\n　　 \n　　为贯彻落实省市县关于疫情防控工作会议精神，打好校园疫情防控阻击战，全力保障师生生命安全和身体健康，9月21日下午，尤溪县教育局召开专题会议，对全县中小学、幼儿园校园当前疫情防控工作进行再部署、", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/t20211201_1732817.htm", "docreltime": "2021.09.22 11:26:00", "doctitle": "疫情防控┃尤溪县教育局召开专题会议，对全县中小学、幼儿园校园疫情防控工作进行再部署、再落实", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1848128, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/t20211201_1732817.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1732816, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "小学教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/t20211201_1732816.htm", "content": "\n　　为进一步推进“双减”工作落实，9月13日下午，我市举办中小学课后服务扩面提质暨义务教育质量监测研训活动。市教育局副局长伊永河参加研训活动并讲话。 \n　　 \n　　伊副局长充分肯定了我市近年来中小学课后服务", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/t20211201_1732816.htm", "docreltime": "2021.09.14 08:33:00", "doctitle": "我市举办中小学课后服务扩面提质暨义务教育质量监测研训活动", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1848127, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/t20211201_1732816.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202112/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1689990, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "小学教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/xxjy/202108/t20210803_1689990.htm", "content": " 清教〔20